0dca903:0":"ReLEAF · GEMS Taiwan · iGEM 2026 · 生物製造村","6233680d87d85692:0":"© 2026 · 本 wiki 的內容採用 <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" rel=\"license\">創用 CC 姓名標示 4.0 國際授權</a>。","946b29cf3ed78d75:0":"建置本網站所用的程式庫位於 <a href=\"https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/gems-taiwan\">gitlab.igem.org/2026/gems-taiwan</a>。","f0ca10f343249063:0":"目錄","2d4a1d085d46bb07:0":"本頁內容","220a5d7255e5ddd3:0":"摘要","c0ef3e71481b222b:0":"參考文獻","3d197283cb019b5a:0":"概覽","c9474bf7a0668d73:0":"摘要總結","c7b736bb94cf040e:0":"結論","36d97c985839be8d:0":"生物反應器","d5e9b70ffb7a8b46:0":"跳至主要內容","6d7b06e553996f09:0":"← ReLEAF wiki · 科學教育","ee560ad1ffcaf6ef:0":"看顧每一批次的軟體","43e0ccf3e698cd05:0":"探索 ReLEAF","7af10c84dc36bf20:0":"標準","41f7dca46d3f1b4a:0":"數值","ae5da213b7f896ed:0":"階段","be9a51f29a4a2c5b:0":"已達成","77db24a5e62dfd49:0":"部分達成","921670e479d82a07:0":"未測試","ae1c7f13b7c0c47f:0":"起點","2d16feedeae57355:0":"轉折","727285b9756a287c:0":"目前的原型","a39c392a7815e371:0":"我們的起點","5180f5b46260caaf:0":"功能需求","40a76980b25b5771:0":"所需證據","f787312863739a62:0":"證據與出處","3f63421908094590:0":"目前狀態","264f663526b9e408:0":"三十五個元件構成五個可互換的模組，把 <i>Bacillus subtilis</i> 的綠光感測連到植物保護蛋白的受控表現與分泌。","0c143854e769c47f:0":"我們的元件涵蓋整條基因路徑：從 PCB 發色團的生成、CcaS 感光，到 CcaR 訊號傳遞、PcpcG2 控制的表現，以及三種保護劑載荷的分泌。四個模組整合進一個 Level 2 構築，另有七個 Level 1 元件完成定序確認。<strong>每個元件都以序列、組裝層級、功能與驗證狀態留下文件</strong>，而模組化的架構讓啟動子、感測器與載荷可以各自替換。<strong>這使得這套集合在 ReLEAF 之外也能重複使用</strong>，包括用於 <i>B. subtilis</i> 的其他光控生產系統。","a5767bcd1c2c3118:0":"元件集合","9f437c88cc5c78d5:0":"<a href=\"#whole-system\"><span class=\"abs-ledger__name\">整套系統</span><span class=\"abs-ledger__text\">一個 Level 2 裝置，四個模組放在同一個載體裡</span></a>","aa5e935a3856b9fd:0":"<a href=\"#light-circuit\"><span class=\"abs-ledger__name\">光迴路</span><span class=\"abs-ledger__text\">發色團、受體、調節子：三個 Level 1 單元</span></a>","468981b9e3b702bc:0":"<a href=\"#green-light-cassettes\"><span class=\"abs-ledger__name\">綠光卡匣</span><span class=\"abs-ledger__text\">放在 P<sub>cpcG2-veg</sub> 之後的 ACC 去胺酶，以及留空的卡匣</span></a>","38ffb6ef41566bc9:0":"<a href=\"#protectant-cassettes\"><span class=\"abs-ledger__name\">保護劑卡匣</span><span class=\"abs-ledger__text\">八個組成型單元，光控版本的對照基準</span></a>","83c2f1ba3e862f7c:0":"<a href=\"#secretion-fusions\"><span class=\"abs-ledger__name\">分泌融合序列</span><span class=\"abs-ledger__text\">載荷、訊號胜肽、His 標籤：八個 Level 0 元件</span></a>","a62147208674158e:0":"全部元件","98b1cb8fb62909ec:0":"分組","0e4b83c4eb9d8535:0":"<i></i>整套系統","bfde25c3072b961c:0":"<i></i>光迴路","409e73229c3fad6d:0":"<i></i>綠光","e56fc1bfddacb75d:0":"<i></i>保護劑","3513b3b4f248fd40:0":"<i></i>分泌融合序列","1bcbf3cf67969801:0":"<i></i>載荷序列","209828c987a74153:0":"<i></i>調控元件","d2223afb7d6b100d:0":"類型","bb5b9ef5860838f4:0":"複合元件","ed2d45e3f811c81d:0":"基本元件","74cb3d66f6a668e1:0":"文件","f1c992341f97a428:0":"特性分析","76783561209eaef2:0":"實驗","a2a4698b87a45f8f:0":"設計","6072978917cd0083:0":"35 個元件","a5767bcd1c2c3118:1":"元件集合","4238cac6f81b415a:0":"ReLEAF 的元件集合：2026 年登錄於 iGEM 元件註冊庫的三十五個元件，依組裝層級分組，各列出它是什麼，以及它的 Registry 條目帶有哪些文件。","2e3f2619ed36c3b4:0":"元件","6ab95ca144ecee32:0":"iGEM 元件註冊庫","13ab62950a6c39c0:0":"它是什麼","74cb3d66f6a668e1:1":"文件","07da69ddbc0d4c69:0":"<span class=\"visually-hidden\">功能</span>","96fb505ba948837c:0":"<span class=\"ptable__gno\">Level 2</span> <span class=\"ptable__gname\">整套系統</span> <span class=\"ptable__gn\">1 個元件</span> <span class=\"ptable__gtext\">這個裝置把四個模組接在同一個 pSTK 穿梭載體裡：綠光進來，分泌出去的 ACC 去胺酶出來。它自己的子元件清單就是下面那三個迴路模組，再加上 Csn 綠光卡匣作為第四個；它在三處內部接點上都已確認。</span>","26551ae86246a4ae:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">CcaSR-Csn-AcdS-Histag</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>整套系統</span>","6c66526170aba58e:0":"光控裝置","f1c992341f97a428:1":"<span class=\"st st--char\">特性分析</span>","a522424b9475010d:0":"CcaSR-Csn-AcdS-Histag 是什麼","339af3eff6184419:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>四個模組放在同一個載體裡：由 <i>ho1-pcyA</i> 生成的藻藍膽素、負責看見綠光的 CcaS-m3、把訊號往下傳的 CcaR，以及 <i>P</i><sub>cpcG2-veg</sub> 驅動 ACC 去胺酶接在 Csn 訊號胜肽之後送出細胞。它的設計是在綠光下開啟、在紅光下關閉。","cbb68ca12cf9f012:0":"<span class=\"ptable__gno\">Level 1</span> <span class=\"ptable__gname\">光迴路模組</span> <span class=\"ptable__gn\">3 個元件</span> <span class=\"ptable__gtext\">三個 Level 1 轉錄單元組成這個開關：受體所需的發色團、受體本身，以及把訊號帶到啟動子的調節子。感光單元寄存時放在 <i>P</i><sub>liaG</sub> 之後。</span>","8ac34438bd35ed94:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">PtagC+RBS-Ho1:pcyA-L3S2P21</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>光迴路模組</span>","dec124b3589af3fb:0":"PCB 生成模組","76783561209eaef2:1":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","1f424789759bc4ae:0":"PtagC+RBS-Ho1:pcyA-L3S2P21 是什麼","e7b33038ba156485:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>把細胞自己的血基質轉成藻藍膽素，也就是 CcaS-m3 必須先結合、才能對光反應的發色團。","fa00f93677938301:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">PliaG-RBS0-ccaS-m3-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>光迴路模組</span>","262517867594e332:0":"感光模組","76783561209eaef2:2":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","fe8b8ed89f6a8327:0":"PliaG-RBS0-ccaS-m3-B0015 是什麼","49c9045d9eb4342d:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>放在 <i>P</i><sub>liaG</sub> 之上的 CcaS-m3。在有藻藍膽素的情況下，它會在綠光下自磷酸化，啟動訊號。","ea4e3a7d349e5c46:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-RBS0-ccaR-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>光迴路模組</span>","9aa8e6f8005337b7:0":"訊號傳遞模組","76783561209eaef2:3":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","dff42a99894f6004:0":"Pveg-RBS0-ccaR-B0015 是什麼","71677b03a550f478:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>放在 <i>P</i><sub>veg</sub> 之上的 CcaR。它從 CcaS-m3 接下磷酸基，把 <i>P</i><sub>cpcG2-veg</sub> 打開。","fcbdd86069d85bc2:0":"<span class=\"ptable__gno\">Level 1</span> <span class=\"ptable__gname\">綠光卡匣</span> <span class=\"ptable__gn\">3 個元件</span> <span class=\"ptable__gtext\">系統中對光有反應的那一半：保護劑放在 <i>P</i><sub>cpcG2-veg</sub> 之後，由上面那三個迴路模組來開關。其中兩個帶 ACC 去胺酶，各配一種訊號胜肽；第三個以螢光 dropout 把載荷的位置留空，作為我們還沒建出來的保護劑的入口。</span>","712a251e0c3145ce:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">PcpcG2-veg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-AcdS-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>綠光卡匣</span>","96a3fd309787addf:0":"綠光卡匣","76783561209eaef2:4":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","0efde3fc9dce8161:0":"PcpcG2-veg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-AcdS-Histag-B0015 是什麼","931b0c5d663868f5:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>ACC 去胺酶放在綠光啟動子之後，由 Csn 帶出細胞。這就是 Level 2 裝置作為第四個模組所帶的卡匣。","748b8e7e8a26ca66:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">PcpcG2-veg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-AcdS 2.1-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>綠光卡匣</span>","96a3fd309787addf:1":"綠光卡匣","bf596ff63b090f99:0":"PcpcG2-veg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-AcdS 2.1-Histag-B0015 是什麼","14769832d2de6acd:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>同一個卡匣，以 SamyQ 取代 Csn，載荷換成重新編碼的 AcdS 2.1。","8e009501c97d971d:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">CDS replacable cassette-mScarlet-I</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>綠光卡匣</span>","d600892f7fabe04c:0":"<span class=\"noreg noreg--draft\">草稿</span>","6047aedd100c57e4:0":"接受端卡匣","50b56a69ddb6bfce:0":"CDS replacable cassette-mScarlet-I 是什麼","71edde2e665b87dc:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>刻意留空的卡匣：<i>P</i><sub>cpcG2-veg</sub> 與 EEBD-RBS0 接在 sfGFP 與 mScarlet-I 的 dropout 之前，而那裡原本是載荷的位置，因此任何保護劑都可以放進去。","31c97c03f88c8078:0":"<span class=\"ptable__gno\">Level 1</span> <span class=\"ptable__gname\">保護劑卡匣</span> <span class=\"ptable__gn\">8 個元件</span> <span class=\"ptable__gtext\">同樣的載荷，放在組成型的 <i>P</i><sub>veg</sub> 之後。建造它們是為了先把分泌與偵測單獨做通，同時也給光控版本一個對照基準。</span>","dbc513bb4b346d66:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-AcdS-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:0":"保護劑卡匣","f1c992341f97a428:2":"<span class=\"st st--char\">特性分析</span>","d4d58cd30831625d:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-AcdS-Histag-B0015 是什麼","3cc3f2b23cd59f23:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>ACC 去胺酶放在組成型啟動子上，以 Csn 分泌。西方墨點法與生物反應器的時間序列都是用這個構築做的。","65716b12ebfee516:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-AcdS 2.1-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:1":"保護劑卡匣","f1c992341f97a428:3":"<span class=\"st st--char\">特性分析</span>","1dd381d97bafeecd:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-AcdS 2.1-Histag-B0015 是什麼","76aae53822fb3ec8:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>同一個卡匣，搭配 SamyQ 與重新編碼的 AcdS 2.1。","b7205ee75a2fe630:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-LEA14-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:2":"保護劑卡匣","76783561209eaef2:5":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","aabe89eab272526f:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-Csn-LEA14-Histag-B0015 是什麼","aed48b9f1bdf548e:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>LEA14 放在 <i>P</i><sub>veg</sub> 之後，以 Csn 分泌。","7b6926c8b03f6cea:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-LEA14 2.1-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:3":"保護劑卡匣","76783561209eaef2:6":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","9b32da93e5b12309:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-LEA14 2.1-Histag-B0015 是什麼","87a371820935cd0a:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>LEA14 2.1 放在 <i>P</i><sub>veg</sub> 之後，以 SamyQ 分泌。","0f128cfaac009fd4:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-BoPep4-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:4":"保護劑卡匣","76783561209eaef2:7":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","25c434627ce09b0b:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-BoPep4-Histag-B0015 是什麼","b56c737927643604:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>來自青花菜的激發子胜肽放在 <i>P</i><sub>veg</sub> 之後，以 SamyQ 分泌。","5e8df5075a26abd5:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-BoPep4 2.1-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>保護劑卡匣</span>","75ff9353b53973af:5":"保護劑卡匣","76783561209eaef2:8":"<span class=\"st st--expe\">實驗</span>","f5ff45be9c893198:0":"Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-BoPep4 2.1-Histag-B0015 是什麼","afbb810fa77ab425:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>同一個卡匣，帶的是 BoPep4 2.1，也就是第一次重新編碼的版本。","6c66a3fb909f12ca:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">Pveg-EEBD-RBS0-SamyQ-BoPep4 2.2-Histag-B0015</span><span class=\"pta