stag 是什麼","131e799f43e9e39b:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">複合元件</span>BoPep4 第 15 至 23 段的截短形式，搭配 SamyQ 與 His<sub>6</sub>。","046fbdfb63856a9a:0":"<span class=\"ptable__gno\">Level 0</span> <span class=\"ptable__gname\">載荷序列</span> <span class=\"ptable__gn\">8 個元件</span> <span class=\"ptable__gtext\">系統要送出的三種蛋白質，每一種都針對 <i>Bacillus subtilis</i> 做過密碼子最佳化，另外還有它們前十五個密碼子的重新編碼版本，以及一個截短形式。</span>","e89d012234d71dc6:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">AcdS</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>載荷序列</span>","4a4b058d7dc5f69b:0":"ACC 去胺酶","a2a4698b87a45f8f:1":"<span class=\"st st--desi\">設計</span>","f1e7338c9d5cffd8:0":"AcdS 是什麼","480520bd9ab96a05:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">基本元件</span>來自 <i>Pseudomonas putida</i> UW4 的 ACC 去胺酶。它會分解乙烯的前驅物 ACC，讓處於逆境的植物少生成那個抑制其生長的激素。","3293eb3f5bc5a63b:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">AcdS 2.1</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>載荷序列</span>","4a4b058d7dc5f69b:1":"ACC 去胺酶","a2a4698b87a45f8f:2":"<span class=\"st st--desi\">設計</span>","8f51bb442756ee41:0":"AcdS 2.1 是什麼","96a941171564a7b8:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">基本元件</span>同一個酵素，前十五個密碼子經重新編碼，以放鬆 mRNA 在轉譯起始處的結構。","f4deb8f1fb3c0cda:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">LEA14</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>載荷序列</span>","180934571abcfe43:0":"LEA14 蛋白質","a2a4698b87a45f8f:3":"<span class=\"st st--desi\">設計</span>","2e2542d69570bfd4:0":"LEA14 是什麼","664d5edb68cbff01:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">基本元件</span>來自 <i>Arabidopsis thaliana</i>（<i>At1g01470</i>）的一種晚期胚胎發生豐富蛋白；據報告，在植物中過量表現它可以提高耐鹽性。","67980750e311a917:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">LEA14 2.1</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>載荷序列</span>","180934571abcfe43:1":"LEA14 蛋白質","a2a4698b87a45f8f:4":"<span class=\"st st--desi\">設計</span>","bda0ec659f948635:0":"LEA14 2.1 是什麼","56fb7bdca1af500c:0":"<span class=\"pmeta\">基本元件</span>同一個蛋白質，前十五個密碼子經重新編碼。","300306e62621c7b5:0":"<span class=\"ptable__nm\">BoPep4</span><span class=\"ptable__rmod\"><span class=\"mdot\"></span>載荷序列<